keywords:
  - human-AI collaboration
  - agentic AI
  - external memory
  - distributed cognition
  - methodology
  - context engineering
  - verification oracles
abstract: >-
  A discipline of forming, maintaining, and cascading hierarchical external
  representations across the manifestation trajectory of a project, for
  sustained human-AI coupling on complex problems. The substrate is the
  deliberately pinned centroid of the collaborating ensemble and a compressed
  representation of the work being manifested; agentic pipelines expand it,
  verification oracles bound the distortion, and the discipline's purpose is
  the separation of genuine human creative input from cognitive load.
